st one who froze when she said the word "freeze" would get a prize. Everyone started counting to 10 out loud and getting ready to freeze.

When the teacher said "freeze!", Paul jumped up and froze on the spot. All of the other pupils were amazed at how quickly Paul was able to freeze. 

